%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a triangle mesh from an array. A type 4 shading's
% DataSource array holds three vertices with edge flags 0 0 0 and RGB
% colours; the page carries a mesh shading of one triangle with those
% vertices and colours, re-encoded into the packed form with a decode
% array made from the columns' extents.
gsave
100 400 translate
<< /ShadingType 4 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /DataSource [ 0 0 0 1 0 0   0 100 0 0 1 0   0 50 80 0 0 1 ] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
